</span></font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><!--StartFragment--><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #eaeaea\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 학부(과)가 1:1로 변경되는 경우 : 원스톱으로 복학 신청<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→ 복학 확정 후 교무처에서 일괄 학과 변경</span></font></span></span></span></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #eaeaea\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→&nbsp;예외 학과 //&nbsp;물리학전공 3학년, 4학년</font></span></font></p><p><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #eaeaea\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: 학사서비스센터 방문&nbsp;복학 신청, 학과 방문 병행(필히 상담 받으세요)</font></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#747474\">&nbsp;</font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #eaeaea\">&nbsp; 나. 학부(과)/전공을 선택해야 하는&nbsp;경우 : 학사서비스센터 방문 복학 신청</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #eaeaea\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; → 복학신청 시 복학원에 복학학과 기재→ 복학 확정 후 교무처에서&nbsp;학과 변경 처리</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #eaeaea\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; →&nbsp;예외 학과 // 기계계열, 기계공학부 1학년 2학기~4학년</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #eaeaea\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 원스톱서비스로 복학 신청, 학과행정실로 학과 배정 신청</font></span></font></p><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #eaeaea\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; →&nbsp;예외 학과 //&nbsp;정보나노소재공학전공 3~4학년</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #eaeaea\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: 원스톱서비스로 복학 신청, 학부행정실로&nbsp;전공 배정 신청</font></span></p></span><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p></font><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">2. </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">복학기간 : 2014.02.03.(월)~02.10.(월)</span></strong></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style